{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026SYRMXUdgKs1792770370.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>臺日電梯未有為升降機安裝耐火門框組件事件，機電署稱，所有涉事樓宇門框組件勘察，以及安裝工程已展開，包括兩個租置屋邨，以及338幢私人樓宇。</p><p></p><p>而署方繼續巡查其他註冊升降機承辦商負責的工程，最新再巡查多30幢樓宇，累計巡查共150幢，全部升降機都有安裝門框組件。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T16:44:06.331793+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T15:40:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T23:18:12.281303+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T16:38:17.228241+00:00","content_hash":"6b181a221b93ca4f20d4359b2dd9d93ca4f81ad821e6475a7e4b1820e7367a7c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}